  "prompt": "Use the uploaded user photo as the ONLY identity reference for the person.

IDENTITY PRESERVATION IS THE HIGHEST PRIORITY.

Create a highly realistic cinematic music-listening portrait of the exact person from the uploaded reference image.

Preserve the subject’s real facial identity, gender, approximate age, ethnicity, facial proportions, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, jawline, ears, hairstyle, hairline, hair texture, facial hair, tattoos, piercings and all other distinctive features.

Do not replace, blend, beautify or reinterpret the person.

The final subject must remain immediately recognizable as the uploaded person.

SCENE:

A single person wearing large premium over-ear headphones, standing or sitting in a dark minimal studio environment.

The subject is shown from approximately the upper chest upward.

Pose the person in a calm 3/4 side profile or soft near-profile angle, with the head slightly tilted upward.

The eyes are completely closed.

The face is relaxed.

The lips are naturally closed.

The expression should communicate deep immersion in music, calm concentration, emotional connection and peaceful isolation.

No smile.

No dramatic facial expression.

The person should look as if they are completely absorbed in the song.

HEADPHONES:

Large modern over-ear wireless headphones.

Premium dark metallic or matte black finish.

Thick ear cushions.

Realistic materials.

Subtle highlights along the ear cups and headband.

The headphones must sit naturally around the ears and follow the shape of the head correctly.

Do not make them oversized, futuristic or unrealistic.

CLOTHING:

Simple dark shirt, black T-shirt, dark sweatshirt or dark minimal top.

No visible logos.

No large prints.

No branding.

The clothing should remain understated so the face, headphones and lighting dominate the image.

LIGHTING:

Strong cinematic dual-color lighting.

A cool electric cyan / deep blue rim light comes from behind and slightly to one side, creating a bright glowing outline around the back of the head, headphones, neck and shoulder.

On the opposite side, use a restrained red-magenta or warm pink accent light touching the edge of the face, forehead, cheek, neck and clothing.

The main facial illumination remains soft, dark and realistic.

The center of the face should not be overexposed.

Preserve natural skin detail.

The cyan rim light may create a subtle luminous aura around the silhouette, but it must still look photographic rather than supernatural.

BACKGROUND:

Very dark navy-blue to almost black studio background.

Minimal environment.

