CAMERA:

Professional full-frame portrait camera.

Approximately 70–105mm portrait lens.

Eye-level or very slightly low camera position.

Vertical portrait composition.

Moderately shallow depth of field.

Face and headphones sharply focused.

Background soft and unobtrusive.

High dynamic range.

Premium editorial portrait quality.

PHOTOREALISM:

